{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "encounter_id": "03028",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 0.87,
      "end_seconds": 4.38,
      "duration_seconds": 3.51,
      "text": "Good evening, doctor, thanks for seeing me."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 5.25,
      "end_seconds": 10.04,
      "duration_seconds": 4.79,
      "text": "Yes, come in and sit down. What brings you here today?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "FAMILY_MEMBER",
      "start_seconds": 11.62,
      "end_seconds": 16.48,
      "duration_seconds": 4.86,
      "text": "Morning, doctor. I'll stay and fill in anything that's missed."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 18.3,
      "end_seconds": 26.08,
      "duration_seconds": 7.78,
      "text": "I'm here because of blurred vision. I'd rather know what's going on than keep guessing."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 28.12,
      "end_seconds": 35.38,
      "duration_seconds": 7.26,
      "text": "So, how long has it been like this? Just so I get the full picture."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 35.95,
      "end_seconds": 46.07,
      "duration_seconds": 10.12,
      "text": "Hm. It was either the end of last month or earlier than that. I couldn't tell you the date."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 46.82,
      "end_seconds": 56.75,
      "duration_seconds": 9.93,
      "text": "Sorry, what was I saying, and the other thing I wanted to mention is that I can't really—"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "FAMILY_MEMBER",
      "start_seconds": 56.85,
      "end_seconds": 62.97,
      "duration_seconds": 6.12,
      "text": "Uh, tell the doctor about the other thing, that's what worries me."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 64.52,
      "end_seconds": 73.49,
      "duration_seconds": 8.97,
      "text": "I was getting to that! Erm, I've also had a splash of cleaning fluid in my eye."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "UNKNOWN",
      "start_seconds": 75.38,
      "end_seconds": 77.52,
      "duration_seconds": 2.14,
      "text": "Yes, exactly like that."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 83.22,
      "end_seconds": 86.49,
      "duration_seconds": 3.27,
      "text": "And what about both eyes or head injury?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 88.57,
      "end_seconds": 100.21,
      "duration_seconds": 11.64,
      "text": "No, no both eyes, no head injury. I did have severe burning at one point, but that went away on its own."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 101.97,
      "end_seconds": 104.06,
      "duration_seconds": 2.09,
      "text": "Is your mobility otherwise okay?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 105.1,
      "end_seconds": 106.91,
      "duration_seconds": 1.81,
      "text": "No, nothing there."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 107.74,
      "end_seconds": 111.38,
      "duration_seconds": 3.64,
      "text": "Anything with your nerves, like weakness or numbness?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 113.34,
      "end_seconds": 114.82,
      "duration_seconds": 1.48,
      "text": "Nothing odd there."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 126.26,
      "end_seconds": 129.7,
      "duration_seconds": 3.44,
      "text": "What do you take on a normal day?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 130.47,
      "end_seconds": 141.18,
      "duration_seconds": 10.71,
      "text": "Metoprolol. I take it 50 milligrams, twice a day. Lansoprazole. I take it 30 milligrams, maybe, before breakfast for my acidity."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 143.02,
      "end_seconds": 147.35,
      "duration_seconds": 4.33,
      "text": "Have you got the box or the prescription on you?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 148.96,
      "end_seconds": 158.66,
      "duration_seconds": 9.7,
      "text": "Not with me. I'll bring it next time. I take naproxen, 250 milligrams, twice a day for the knee pain."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "FAMILY_MEMBER",
      "start_seconds": 159.79,
      "end_seconds": 169.58,
      "duration_seconds": 9.79,
      "text": "Doctor, I think the last prescription for the naproxen was 500 milligrams. We changed it at the last visit."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 171.35,
      "end_seconds": 175.79,
      "duration_seconds": 4.44,
      "text": "Right. Do you happen to have the current prescription here?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 180.27,
      "end_seconds": 194.2,
      "duration_seconds": 13.93,
      "text": "Actually, no, I left it at home. I take hydrocortisone cream, when needed for the eczema. My neighbour said I should get it looked at."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 194.85,
      "end_seconds": 197.61,
      "duration_seconds": 2.76,
      "text": "Do you have any long-term conditions?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 198.24,
      "end_seconds": 201.9,
      "duration_seconds": 3.66,
      "text": "I've got heart failure. I've got acid reflux."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 202.9,
      "end_seconds": 204.21,
      "duration_seconds": 1.31,
      "text": "And besides that?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 205.54,
      "end_seconds": 211.3,
      "duration_seconds": 5.76,
      "text": "I have arthritis in my knees. I have eczema, for five years."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 212.67,
      "end_seconds": 222.06,
      "duration_seconds": 9.39,
      "text": "Yes, arthritis in your knees is known to us, good to have that clear. Tell me about your eating."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 224.09,
      "end_seconds": 229.25,
      "duration_seconds": 5.16,
      "text": "I drink a lot of tea and snack through the day."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 231.27,
      "end_seconds": 233.4,
      "duration_seconds": 2.13,
      "text": "Do you live by yourself?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 234.59,
      "end_seconds": 238.36,
      "duration_seconds": 3.77,
      "text": "No, I share a house with my brother."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 240.32,
      "end_seconds": 243.54,
      "duration_seconds": 3.22,
      "text": "Are there any illnesses in your family?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 245.55,
      "end_seconds": 251.77,
      "duration_seconds": 6.22,
      "text": "Hmm, my mother has an underactive thyroid. My father has Parkinson's disease."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 265.06,
      "end_seconds": 267.57,
      "duration_seconds": 2.51,
      "text": "Let me take your readings now."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 278.62,
      "end_seconds": 281.24,
      "duration_seconds": 2.62,
      "text": "Keep your arm relaxed for me..."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 296.56,
      "end_seconds": 308.03,
      "duration_seconds": 11.47,
      "text": "Okay: BP is 122 over 81, temperature is 36.8 degrees, pulse is 84 beats a minute. And respiratory rate 15, oxygen saturation is 99 percent."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 309.87,
      "end_seconds": 311.37,
      "duration_seconds": 1.5,
      "text": "Is that normal?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 313.01,
      "end_seconds": 316.13,
      "duration_seconds": 3.12,
      "text": "I'll explain what these mean in a moment."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 318.04,
      "end_seconds": 322.31,
      "duration_seconds": 4.27,
      "text": "Let me look at the area, I'll be gentle."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 323.18,
      "end_seconds": 325.36,
      "duration_seconds": 2.18,
      "text": "Tell me if that's sore."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 343.26,
      "end_seconds": 351.5,
      "duration_seconds": 8.24,
      "text": "The eye is very red with a cloudy cornea and the pH of the tears is very high."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0042",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 356.81,
      "end_seconds": 370.4,
      "duration_seconds": 13.59,
      "text": "Good, you can sit up again. So, based on the history and the examination, this looks most like an alkali chemical burn to the eye. We shouldn't forget a corneal abrasion."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0043",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 371.34,
      "end_seconds": 374.68,
      "duration_seconds": 3.34,
      "text": "What are the odds it's serious?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0044",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 376.08,
      "end_seconds": 389.99,
      "duration_seconds": 13.91,
      "text": "Nothing I've seen today points to an emergency. It looks like an alkali chemical burn to the eye, but I'd like to confirm. Let's book an urgent eye assessment to look into chemical eye injury."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0045",
      "speaker_id": "person_5",
      "role": "CLINICAL_STAFF",
      "start_seconds": 391.96,
      "end_seconds": 394.97,
      "duration_seconds": 3.01,
      "text": "The earliest is Thursday, 11:30 am."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0046",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 397.05,
      "end_seconds": 399.33,
      "duration_seconds": 2.28,
      "text": "Okay, I'll be there."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0047",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 400.02,
      "end_seconds": 429.55,
      "duration_seconds": 29.53,
      "text": "Let's book an urgent pH check to look into chemical burn. What I'm giving you is sterile saline irrigation, 2 litres, continuous, until pH neutral. It's for chemical eye burn. I am washing the eye now, keep it open and do not stop. I think the eye emergency service should see you too. And please bring the latest prescription or the medicine boxes to the next visit, so we can settle the dose."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0048",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 431.39,
      "end_seconds": 434.86,
      "duration_seconds": 3.47,
      "text": "Yes, I'll bear that in mind."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0049",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 436.84,
      "end_seconds": 443.96,
      "duration_seconds": 7.12,
      "text": "Let's plan a check straight away. Before we finish, can you repeat the plan back to me?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0050",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 444.9,
      "end_seconds": 455.48,
      "duration_seconds": 10.58,
      "text": "So, I take the sterile saline irrigation, 2 litres, continuous and come back straight away. Is that right?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0051",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 457.5,
      "end_seconds": 461.94,
      "duration_seconds": 4.44,
      "text": "Yes, exactly right. Anything else on your mind before you go?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0052",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 463.31,
      "end_seconds": 466.79,
      "duration_seconds": 3.48,
      "text": "Good, thanks, I'll see you then."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0053",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 467.53,
      "end_seconds": 468.77,
      "duration_seconds": 1.24,
      "text": "All the best."
    }
  ]
}